					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-764027#post-2681788</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-764027/scp-1992-j#post-2681788</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Nov 2016 20:58:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Cyclopian</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1990708</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Unlike previous events, two SCP-1992-1 instances manifested and were derailed when they crashed into each other. Most passengers survived the derailment, however, as before they impacted the ground their descent was slowed and they were forced into a soft landing. Both conductors reported that the crash occurred because, despite the two trains' close proximity, they were unable to see each other. All surviving passengers were erased two weeks after the derailment was discovered.</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
