					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Nah bra, I know the ref, it's Indianananana Jawns and the Crystal Movie of DOOM!™ where he survives the nuclear blast in the old lead-lined refrigerator. (also, it TOTALLY lists the movie there in the list, so anyone who doesn't get the reference should in theory, be able to <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Arib8uWMWsM">google it and know it very quickly</a>)</p> <p>It just doesn't read smoothly in my opinion to say, &quot;The UFO crashed into a water tower, and the train derailed, killing all inside. A single passenger was found several kilometers from the crash site, having apparently sought shelter in the train's kitchen refrigerator. He was also dead.&quot;</p> <p>Killed all. A single passenger was found. Took shelter in a fridge. Still dead.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
